<title>LATVIA: POLIGRAFISTS PRINTER PUBLIC OFFER IN MAY.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFISTS PRINTER PUBLIC OFFER IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian Privatisation Agency said on Thursday that it had decided to announce the subscription for shares in the Poligrafists printing house from May 12 to May 30 for privatisation vouchers.</p>
<p>A 22 percent stake or 82,280 shares will be sold in the company, the LPA said in a statement.</p>
<p>The controlling stake of Poligrafists or 45 percent is held by Zvaigzne ABC publishers with the remaining stake reserved for employees, and the pension fund and share reserve.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
